= The Battle of Coruscant

General Grievous has raided Coruscant itself and kidnapped Supreme Chancellor Palpatine. In a desperate rescue above the capital, Anakin Skywalker and Obi-Wan Kenobi free him. [? if dooku_dead : Count Dooku is dead, struck down by Anakin, unarmed, at the Chancellor's urging. ?][? if dooku_turned : Count Dooku, in hiding since he betrayed his master, was not aboard. ?]

The Chancellor returns to the Senate a hero. The war seems nearly won. In the Senate's shadowed offices, the Delegation knows that the next few days will decide what kind of Republic survives it.

*The game now moves day by day. You have at most twelve days.*
